WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.440
it is well enough that people of the nation do&nbsp;
not understand our banking and monetary system&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:12.000
for if they did i believe there would&nbsp;
be a revolution before tomorrow morning

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.200
the only real mistake is the&nbsp;
one from which we learn nothing

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:30.560
anyone who stops learning is old whether at&nbsp;
20 or 80 anyone who keeps learning stays young&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.800
the greatest thing in life&nbsp;
is to keep your mind young

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:45.040
thinking is the hardest work there is which&nbsp;
is probably the reason why so few engage in it

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:57.840
coming together is a beginning keeping together&nbsp;
is progress working together is success

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:04.960
there is no man living that cannot&nbsp;
do more than he thinks he can

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:13.200
enthusiasm is the east that makes&nbsp;
your hopes shine to the stars

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:19.520
when everything seems to be going against you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:25.840
remember that the airplane takes&nbsp;
off against the wind not with it

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:32.960
nothing is particularly hard if&nbsp;
you divide it into small jobs

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:42.800
if money is your hope for independence you&nbsp;
will never have it the only real security&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:49.360
that a man will have in this world is a&nbsp;
reserve of knowledge experience and ability

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:59.280
failure is simply the opportunity to&nbsp;
begin again this time more intelligently&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:10.480
the whole secret of a successful life is to find&nbsp;
out what is one's destiny to do and then do it

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:21.840
if you always do what you've always done&nbsp;
you'll always get what you've always got

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:29.520
competition is the key cutting edge of&nbsp;
business always shaving away at costs

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:35.840
one of the greatest discoveries a man makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:42.480
one of his great surprises is to find he&nbsp;
can do what he was afraid he couldn't do

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:51.760
if you think you can do a thing or&nbsp;
think you can't do a thing you're right

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:58.640
a business that makes nothing&nbsp;
but money is a poor business

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:07.680
obstacles are those frightful things you&nbsp;
see when you take your eyes off your goal

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:17.840
education is preeminently a&nbsp;
matter of quality not amount

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:26.400
the short successes that can be gained in a brief&nbsp;
time and without difficulty are not worth much

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:34.320
the competitor to be feared is&nbsp;
one who never bothers about you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:38.800
at all but goes on making his&nbsp;
own business better all the time

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:46.240
the genius of the american people is self-reliance

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:59.840
america is not a land of money but of wealth not&nbsp;
a land of rich people but of successful workers

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.880
greatest thing we can produce is character&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:14.000
everything else can be taken&nbsp;
from us but not our character

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:18.080
the unhappiest man on earth is&nbsp;
the one who has nothing to do

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:27.840
a nation that knows how to work will never suffer

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:38.640
you

